# Replit Patch — Voluntary, Changeable Sex, Gender, Pronoun, and Age Context

**Scope:** Add private member context for age-appropriate delivery, medically relevant opt-in context, respectful language, and voluntary safety feedback. This patch must not expose a member’s sex, gender, age, or pronouns on public profiles; infer them; use them for advertising/partnerships; or use them in creator/business matching.

> **Data minimization rule:** Store only the member’s explicit selections. Do not infer sex, gender, pronouns, pregnancy status, medical status, culture, ethnicity, or minority status from a name, photo, voice, language, location, searches, behavior, or social graph.

---

## 1. Product terms and user-facing choices

Use **two separate optional questions**, because they serve different purposes:

| Private field | Exact member-facing label | Allowed choices | When it may be used |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Sex assigned at birth | `Sex assigned at birth (optional)` | `Female`, `Male`, `Intersex`, `Prefer not to say` | Only for an opted-in medically relevant response where it matters, such as reproductive anatomy or population-health context. |
| Gender identity | `Gender identity (optional)` | `Woman`, `Man`, `Nonbinary`, `Another identity`, `Prefer not to say` | Respectful language and a separate voluntary safety-feedback aggregation selection. |
| Pronouns | `Pronouns (optional)` | `She/her`, `He/him`, `They/them`, `Use my name`, `Custom`, `Prefer not to say` | Writing tone only, if the member enables it. |
| Age range | `Age range` | `13–15`, `16–17`, `18+` | Private age-appropriate delivery policy only. |

Do not require a free-text gender value in release 1. If `Another identity` is selected, store the label only. A custom pronoun string is optional, encrypted at rest, maximum 80 characters, and is never used outside member-facing language.

> **Private by default:** These values do not appear on public profiles, community posts, business pages, Circles, creator cards, business-owner dashboards, notifications, exports, or analytics.

